":{"en":{"bdb":"“Its name is Avivek (ignorance) and it abides in your heart"},"pu":{"ss":"ਤੇਰੇ ਹਿਰਦੇ ਵਿਚ ਉਸ ਦਾ ਠਿਕਾਣਾ ਹੈ।"}}},{"verse_id":104878,"page_no":691,"line_no":104878,"gurmukhi":"ਤਿਹ ਜੀਤ ਕਹੀ ਨ ਭੂਪ ॥","translit_en":"teh jeet kahee na bhoop ||","translation":{"pu":{"ss":"ਉਸ ਨੂੰ ਕਿਸੇ ਵੀ ਰਾਜੇ ਨੇ ਨਹੀਂ ਜਿਤਿਆ।"}}},{"verse_id":104879,"page_no":691,"line_no":104879,"gurmukhi":"ਵਹ ਹੈ ਸਰੂਪ ਅਨੂਪ ॥੧੬੫॥","translit_en":"veh hai saroop anoop ||165||","translation":{"en":{"bdb":"Regarding its victory, O king! you have not said anything, that also has a unique form.”165."},"pu":{"ss":"ਉਹ ਅਨੂਪਮ ਸਰੂਪ ਵਾਲਾ ਹੈ ॥੧੬੫॥"}}}],"nav":{"prev":9425,"next":9427}}